<h2>Adaptasi</h2>
Adaptasi.
Sangkan bisa tetep hirup di lingkungan anu beurat, daun bisa ngaluyukeun manéh ku sababaraha cara:
<ul>
<li>Bulu na beungeut daun pikeun 'néwak' kalembaban di nu cuaca garing, sangkan teu loba teuing &lt;a href="saab"&gt;nyaab&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Léaves rustle to move humidity away from the surface reducing the boundary layer resistance between the léaf and the air.</li>
<li>Plant prickles are modified clusters of epidermal hairs</li>
<li>Dilapis &lt;a href="lilin"&gt;lilin&lt;/a&gt; sangkan teu loba teuing nyaab</li>
<li>Small, shiny léaves to deflect the &lt;a href="sun"&gt;sun&lt;/a&gt;'s rays</li>
<li>Ngandelan pikeun neundeun cai (misalna &lt;a href="cocor%20b%C3%A9b%C3%A9k"&gt;cocor bébék&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Change to spines instéad of laminar (blade) léaves (e.g. &lt;a href="cactus"&gt;cactus&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Shrink (to &lt;a href="phyllode"&gt;phyllode&lt;/a&gt;s) or disappéar (with the appéarance of &lt;a href="cladode"&gt;cladode&lt;/a&gt;s), as photosynthetic functions are transferred to the léaf stem (&lt;a href="Acacia"&gt;Acacia&lt;/a&gt; species)</li>
<li>Robah bentuk sangkan teu pati katebak angin</li>
<li>Léaves to trap insects (e.g. &lt;a href="pitcher%20plant"&gt;pitcher plant&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Change to bulb parts to store food (e.g. &lt;a href="onion"&gt;onion&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Ngahasilkeun minyak aromatik pikeun ngusir hérbivora (misalna &lt;a href="%C3%A9kaliptus"&gt;ékaliptus&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Protect as &lt;a href="Spine%20%28botany%29"&gt;spines&lt;/a&gt;, which are modified léaves.</li>
<li>Ngarobah kelir pikeun ngirut &lt;a href="serangga"&gt;serangga&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="manuk"&gt;manuk&lt;/a&gt; (misalna &lt;a href="Poinsettia"&gt;Poinsettia&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
</ul>
