Gerakna cai dina jero zona vadose ditalungtik dina elmu &lt;a href="soil%20physics"&gt;fisika taneuh&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="hydrology"&gt;hidrologi&lt;/a&gt;, sabagéan &lt;a href="hydrogeology"&gt;hidrogeologi&lt;/a&gt;, sarta penting keur kaperluan &lt;a href="agrikultur"&gt;tatanen&lt;/a&gt;, nyebarna &lt;a href="contaminant"&gt;kontaminan&lt;/a&gt;, tur &lt;a href="flood%20control"&gt;kontrol banjir&lt;/a&gt;.
