<doc id="4436" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4436" title="Manyogana">
Manyogana

&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;Tulisan Jepang&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="Kanji"&gt;Kanji&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;a href="Kana"&gt;Kana&lt;/a&gt; 
